T1  - Feasibility & Effect of a Tele-rehabilitation Program for Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease vs. Standard Rehabilitation
JF  - https://clinicaltrials.gov/show/NCT03569384
A1  - NCT03569384
KW  - eppi-reviewer
