AB  - Inclusion criteria: ‐ Being 60 years old or older; ‐ Retired; ‐ Accept the invitation to participate in the singing group program; ‐ Not having participated in other intervention programs in the previous four months. Exclusion criteria: ‐ Having a severe impairment, that is disabling for the participation in the singing group activity (e.g. severe cognitive, auditory, visual or mobility impairments). Cognitive Function;Well‐Being;Physical Function;Respiratory Function;Memory;Biomarker;Anxiety;Depression;Stress;Quality of Life;Loneliness;Social Identification;Blood Pressure;Blood Glucose;Cholesterol;C‐reactive Protein;Erythrocyte Sedimentation Rate;Balance;Sleep;Pain Perception;Medication Compliance;Health Complaint, Subjective;Body Weight Other: Alternative Social and Leisure Activities;Other: Singing Group Intervention Program Sleep Quality ‐ Actigraphy (GT3X accelerometer);Pain Perception ‐ The Brief Pain Inventory,;Medication Intake ‐ Social Support Institution;Health Services Attendance ‐ Social Support Institution;Physical Activity ‐ Actigraphy (GT3X accelerometer);Body Balance ‐ Unipedal Stance Test.;Respiratory Function ‐ Spirometry (Medikro Pro) ‐ Air Speed;Respiratory Function ‐ Spirometry (Medikro Pro) ‐ Air Volume;Body Weight ‐ Professional scale;Erythrocyte Sedimentation Rate (ESR) ‐ Blood sample ‐ Licensed laboratory;C‐reactive protein (CRP) ‐ Blood sample ‐ Licensed laboratory;Cholesterol ‐ Blood sample ‐ Licensed laboratory;Glycemia ‐ Blood sample ‐ Licensed laboratory;Pulse ‐ Licensed laboratory;Blood Pressure ‐ Licensed laboratory;Processing Speed ‐ Digit Symbol Test;Attention and Executive Function ‐ Trail Making Test;Short‐term auditory verbal memory ‐ RAVELT;Cognitive Function ‐ MoCA;Social Well‐Being ‐ Scale of Social Well‐Being;Social Identification ‐ FISI;Loneliness ‐ UCLA Loneliness Scale;Self‐Esteem ‐ RSES;Life Satisfaction ‐ SWLS;Positive and Negative Affect ‐ PANAS;Depression, Anxiety and Stress ‐ Dass 21;Quality of Life ‐ WHOQOL‐OLD