T1  - Comparison of Trigger Finger Orthotic Wearing Schedules
JF  - https://clinicaltrials.gov/show/NCT04094389
A1  - NCT04094389
KW  - eppi-reviewer
KW  - Trigger Finger Di
KW  - order
PY  - 2019
DA  - 2019///
