T1  - Effect of Integrating Traditional Tuberculosis Care With Modern Health Care on Case Detection
JF  - https://clinicaltrials.gov/show/NCT05236452
A1  - NCT05236452
KW  - eppi-reviewer
KW  - Latent Tuberculosis
KW  - Tuberculosis
