T1  - Recovery from severe mental illness: an intrapersonal and functional outcome definition
JF  - INTERNATIONAL REVIEW OF PSYCHIATRY
A1  - Noordsy D
A1  - Torrey W
A1  - Mueser K
A1  - Mead S
A1  - O'Keefe C
